## 6. Advanced Features

| Feature | How to enable | When to use |
|---------|---------------|-------------|
| **Lazy loading** | `fetch = FetchType.LAZY` (default for collections) | Avoid unnecessary joins |
| **Cascade** | `cascade = CascadeType.ALL` | Persist / delete child automatically |
| **Orphan removal** | `orphanRemoval = true` | Keep DB consistent when removing child |
| **Second‑level cache** | `hibernate.cache.use_second_level_cache = true` and provider (ehcache, infinispan) | Read‑heavy applications |
| **Stateless session** | `@Stateless` + `EntityManager` injection | High‑throughput, no persistence context |
| **Hibernate specific** | `@org.hibernate.annotations.Cache(usage = CacheConcurrencyStrategy.READ_WRITE)` | Fine‑grained cache control |
| **Batching** | `hibernate.jdbc.batch_size = 50` | Large bulk inserts/updates |
| **Entity graphs** | `@NamedEntityGraph` | Custom fetch strategies without JPQL |

